    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diomedea Keep is a murder-mystery/romance in the fantasy world of the Sluicine Empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE PRINCESS LOVES YOU BACK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your beloved Princess Savyne is betrothed to the worst person in the empire, the Duke. The night before the wedding, Savyne reveals that your love is mutual. You're just the captain of the guard, though\u2014it could never work out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HER FUTURE HUSBAND IS A PRESENT CORPSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next morning, the Duke is found murdered\u2014injected with the plague and bleeding from the eyes. (Good riddance!)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IT'S YOUR JOB TO FIND THE KILLER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it his envious brother? A spy using witchcraft? The Empress, executing some grand strategy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...If it's Princess Savyne herself, how could you possibly accuse her?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT WILL YOU CHOOSE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both justice and love are at stake, so you'll need to balance sleuthing with romance.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How this ends depends on you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diomedea Keep is a murder-mystery/romance in the fantasy world of the Sluicine Empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE PRINCESS LOVES YOU BACK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your beloved Princess Savyne is betrothed to the worst person in the empire, the Duke. The night before the wedding, Savyne reveals that your love is mutual. You're just the captain of the guard, though\u2014it could never work out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HER FUTURE HUSBAND IS A PRESENT CORPSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next morning, the Duke is found murdered\u2014injected with the plague and bleeding from the eyes. (Good riddance!)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IT'S YOUR JOB TO FIND THE KILLER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it his envious brother? A spy using witchcraft? The Empress, executing some grand strategy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...If it's Princess Savyne herself, how could you possibly accuse her?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT WILL YOU CHOOSE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both justice and love are at stake, so you'll need to balance sleuthing with romance.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How this ends depends on you.</p>",
